title: War of the Powers

@certification
title: War of the Powers I — the oath
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_certification_event_done = 1;
Q.pres_2020_phase = "Certification contested";
Q.trz_inauguration_status = "President-elect — oath contested";
const margin = Number(Q.pres_runoff_margin) || 0;
const restraint = Number(Q.constitutional_restraint) || 50;
const courtTrust = Number(Q.judicial_legitimacy) || 36;
const pisCapacity = Number(Q.pis_org_resources) || 9;
Q.trz_obstruction_pressure = Math.max(
    20,
    Math.min(
        88,
        Math.round(
            58 - margin * 2.4 +
            Math.max(0, 50 - restraint) * 0.45 +
            Math.max(0, 42 - courtTrust) * 0.30 +
            pisCapacity * 0.65
        )
    )
);
Q.trz_cohabitation_temperature = 24;
Q.news_headline =
    "PiS contests the road from Trzaskowski's victory to the presidential oath";
!}

= August 2020 — The office is not yet his

PiS accepts that votes were counted and attacks every institution that must
turn the result into power. Loyal lawyers challenge the ballot, the Sejm
Marshal delays the National Assembly and government media calls the result
foreign and urban. The objective is simple: make the oath look optional.

Obstruction pressure: **[+ trz_obstruction_pressure +]/100**.

- @certification_legal
- @certification_public
- @certification_bargain

@certification_legal
title: Lock the count behind one constitutional front
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Courts, Senate lawyers and election observers use one record.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A national legal operation requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; trz_certification_strategy = "Constitutional front"; trz_defence_score = 70; judicial_legitimacy += 7; constitutional_restraint += 6; ko_relation += 5; psl_relation += 3; public_trust += 3; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 5; news_headline = "The opposition builds one record around the certified count"
go-to: certification_result

@certification_public
title: Put mayors, unions and voters around the National Assembly
subtitle: Strong public defence; PiS and Konfederacja gain a siege narrative.
on-arrival: trz_certification_strategy = "Civic mobilisation"; trz_defence_score = 64; turnout_readiness += 5; organiser_energy += 4; public_trust += 2; trz_right_backlash += 9; far_right_agenda += 4; konf_poll_momentum += 0.35; pis_poll_momentum += 0.15; rival_relation_pis_konf += 2; news_headline = "A civic cordon demands that the National Assembly meet"
go-to: certification_result

@certification_bargain
title: Let the Palace negotiate the ceremony with PiS
subtitle: Easier oath, but the first compromise is made before the first day in office.
on-arrival: trz_certification_strategy = "Private transition bargain"; trz_defence_score = 57; president_relation += 5; ko_relation -= 3; pis_relation += 4; constitutional_restraint -= 3; trz_cohabitation_temperature -= 5; trz_right_fragmentation += 4; news_headline = "A private transition bargain secures a date and creates a debt"
go-to: certification_result

@certification_result
title: The National Assembly
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_defence_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.trz_defence_score) || 0) +
    ((Number(Q.judicial_legitimacy) || 36) - 36) * 0.18 +
    ((Number(Q.constitutional_restraint) || 50) - 50) * 0.16 -
    (Number(Q.trz_obstruction_pressure) || 0) * 0.72
);
if (Q.trz_defence_score >= -7) {
    Q.trz_inaugurated = 1;
    Q.trz_blocked = 0;
    Q.president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski";
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation";
    Q.trz_inauguration_status =
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10
            ? "Sworn in — certified mandate"
            : "Sworn in — legitimacy disputed";
    Q.trz_cohabitation_temperature +=
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10 ? 8 : 15;
    Q.trz_right_fragmentation +=
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10 ? 4 : 8;
    Q.trz_right_backlash +=
        Q.trz_defence_score >= 10 ? 3 : 7;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Rafał Trzaskowski takes the oath before a hostile PiS majority";
} else {
    Q.trz_inaugurated = 0;
    Q.trz_inauguration_status = "Oath delayed";
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Constitutional interregnum";
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 8;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The Sejm Marshal prevents the oath and opens an interregnum";
}
!}

Defence balance: **[+ trz_defence_score +]**.

[? if trz_inaugurated: The joint sitting takes place. PiS deputies turn their
backs during the oath; the new President immediately inherits a government
that treats every signature as enemy action. ?]

[? if not trz_inaugurated: The sitting is not convened. The certified winner
has a mandate but no office, while the Sejm Marshal prepares to exercise the
President's powers after Duda's term expires. ?]

- @begin_cohabitation
- @force_oath
- @mobilised_oath
- @accept_repeat

@begin_cohabitation
title: Enter cohabitation
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 1
go-to: poland_hub

@force_oath
title: Force a new sitting through the courts and Senate
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. The oath succeeds, but PiS never recognises the settlement.
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 0
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The exhausted opposition cannot finance the legal and parliamentary operation.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; trz_inaugurated = 1; trz_blocked = 0; president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski"; pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation"; trz_inauguration_status = "Sworn in after constitutional standoff"; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 24; trz_right_fragmentation += 10; trz_right_backlash += 8; judicial_legitimacy += 5; ko_relation += 5; pis_relation -= 8; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 8; news_headline = "A second joint sitting ends the interregnum"
go-to: poland_hub

@mobilised_oath
title: Break the delay with a permanent civic assembly
subtitle: The oath succeeds amid protests; the radical right leaves with a founding myth.
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 0
on-arrival: trz_inaugurated = 1; trz_blocked = 0; president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski"; pres_2020_phase = "Cohabitation"; trz_inauguration_status = "Sworn in during civic mobilisation"; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 28; trz_right_fragmentation += 7; trz_right_backlash += 15; turnout_readiness += 5; far_right_agenda += 7; konf_poll_momentum += 0.7; pis_poll_momentum += 0.25; minority_safety -= 3; news_headline = "Continuous demonstrations force the National Assembly to meet"
go-to: poland_hub

@accept_repeat
title: Accept a repeat election to avoid a rupture
subtitle: PiS succeeds in keeping the certified winner from office.
view-if: trz_inaugurated = 0
on-arrival: trz_blocked = 1; trz_inaugurated = 0; president_name = "Elżbieta Witek (acting)"; pres_2020_phase = "Presidency blocked"; trz_inauguration_status = "Blocked — repeat election conceded"; party_unity -= 10; public_trust -= 8; constitutional_restraint -= 12; judicial_legitimacy -= 8; pis_relation += 6; ko_relation -= 10; trz_right_backlash += 12; pis_poll_momentum += 0.8; news_headline = "The opposition concedes a repeat presidential election"
go-to: poland_hub

@tribunal_showdown
title: War of the Powers II — the Tribunal
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: abortion_event_done = 1; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 12; news_headline = "The abortion judgment opens a war between the Palace and PiS"

= October 2020 — A judgment and a hostile President

The disputed Constitutional Tribunal removes the fetal-impairment ground.
Trzaskowski cannot veto a judgment. He can deny the panel political legitimacy,
refer later statutes and promise his signature to a parliamentary repair.

- @tribunal_palace_bill
- @tribunal_movement
- @tribunal_compromise

@tribunal_palace_bill
title: Write a restoration bill with the Palace and the democratic opposition
subtitle: Trzaskowski promises to sign; PiS and Konfederacja mobilise against both institutions.
on-arrival: abortion_strategy = "Palace restoration front"; trz_abortion_signature = 1; trz_abortion_veto_policy = "Will sign statutory abortion restoration"; president_relation += 8; ko_relation += 5; p2050_relation += 2; feminist_trust += 8; judicial_legitimacy += 5; trz_right_fragmentation += 7; trz_right_backlash += 10; far_right_agenda += 5; pis_poll_momentum += 0.2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.4; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 5; news_headline = "The Palace promises a signature on abortion-law restoration"
go-to: poland_hub

@tribunal_movement
title: Keep the Palace out and resource the Women's Strike
subtitle: Movement autonomy grows; the President gives no advance signature.
on-arrival: abortion_strategy = "Autonomous movement support"; trz_abortion_signature = 0; trz_abortion_veto_policy = "No advance commitment"; feminist_trust += 12; movement_autonomy += 10; organiser_energy += 7; progressive_credibility += 5; president_relation -= 4; barons_dissent += 4; trz_right_backlash += 5; news_headline = "The Women's Strike refuses to become the President's movement"
go-to: poland_hub

@tribunal_compromise
title: Ask Trzaskowski to guarantee the old compromise
subtitle: A narrower promised signature calms PSL and angers the movement.
on-arrival: abortion_strategy = "Presidential compromise"; trz_abortion_signature = 1; trz_abortion_veto_policy = "Will sign restoration of the 1993 compromise"; president_relation += 5; psl_relation += 6; barons_dissent -= 4; feminist_trust -= 10; progressives_dissent += 8; trz_right_fragmentation += 4; trz_right_backlash += 3; news_headline = "The Palace offers its signature to restore the old compromise"
go-to: poland_hub

@judicial_war
title: War of the Powers III — veto government
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: trz_judicial_war_done = 1; trz_cohabitation_temperature += 10; institutional_issue_salience += 12; news_headline = "PiS sends its judicial offensive to a hostile President"

= February 2021 — Two centres of legality

PiS packages court appointments, disciplinary rules and public-media changes
as ordinary administration. The Palace calls them one attempt to govern around
the Constitution. Each veto can stop a statute; none can repair the courts.

- @judicial_veto_front
- @judicial_europe
- @judicial_trade

@judicial_veto_front
title: Maintain one opposition veto list
subtitle: Clear constitutional line; repeated Palace defeats help the right campaign against obstruction.
on-arrival: trz_palace_strategy = "Common veto front"; trz_vetoes += 2; president_relation += 8; ko_relation += 6; p2050_relation += 4; judicial_legitimacy += 8; constitutional_restraint += 6; trz_right_fragmentation += 8; trz_right_backlash += 9; far_right_agenda += 4; pis_poll_momentum += 0.25; konf_poll_momentum += 0.3; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 6; news_headline = "Two presidential vetoes stop the judicial package"
go-to: poland_hub

@judicial_europe
title: Move the conflict to European courts and treaty law
subtitle: Strong legal leverage, easy material for a sovereignty campaign.
on-arrival: trz_palace_strategy = "European judicial escalation"; president_relation += 5; ko_relation += 4; judicial_legitimacy += 10; constitutional_restraint += 3; trz_right_fragmentation += 6; trz_right_backlash += 12; far_right_agenda += 6; konf_poll_momentum += 0.5; minority_safety -= 1; news_headline = "The Palace internationalises the judicial conflict"
go-to: poland_hub

@judicial_trade
title: Trade one appointment law for a pandemic package
subtitle: Delivers policy and fractures the democratic front.
on-arrival: trz_palace_strategy = "Selective cohabitation bargain"; household_security += 5; health_capacity += 4; government_delivery += 4; pis_relation += 6; president_relation += 2; ko_relation -= 6; p2050_relation -= 3; judicial_legitimacy -= 5; constitutional_restraint -= 4; trz_right_fragmentation += 10; trz_right_backlash += 2; news_headline = "A Palace–government bargain splits the judicial package"
go-to: poland_hub

@palace_offensive
title: War of the Powers IV — what the pen is for
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: trz_palace_offensive_done = 1; news_headline = "The Palace asks the opposition what it wants a hostile presidency to build"

= April 2021 — Beyond stopping PiS

Vetoes have made Trzaskowski the government's most visible opponent. He now
asks whether the Palace should remain a brake or sponsor legislation that can
test the United Right's majority.

- @palace_rights
- @palace_institutions
- @palace_social

@palace_rights
title: Sign a public abortion-and-marriage-equality compact
subtitle: Both bills receive a no-veto pledge; the right receives its strongest mobilisation issue.
on-arrival: trz_palace_strategy = "Equality compact"; trz_abortion_signature = 1; trz_marriage_signature = 1; trz_abortion_veto_policy = "Will sign legal abortion restoration"; trz_marriage_veto_policy = "Will sign marriage equality"; president_relation += 10; ko_relation += 5; progressive_credibility += 9; feminist_trust += 8; psl_relation -= 8; trz_right_fragmentation += 9; trz_right_backlash += 15; far_right_agenda += 8; pis_poll_momentum += 0.35; konf_poll_momentum += 0.7; rival_relation_pis_ko -= 6; rival_relation_ko_psl -= 4; news_headline = "Trzaskowski promises not to veto abortion reform or marriage equality"
go-to: poland_hub

