@rights_vote
title: War of the Powers V — test the majority
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: trz_rights_vote_done = 1; opposition_reset_event_done = 1; news_headline = "The opposition decides which presidential promise to test in the Sejm"

= June 2021 — A bill for the President's desk

The United Right is divided but still governs. Only one confrontation can be
organised before the merger congress. A promised presidential signature is not
a parliamentary majority.

- @rights_vote_abortion
- @rights_vote_marriage
- @rights_vote_institutions

@rights_vote_abortion
title: Put statutory abortion restoration to a vote
subtitle: Available only if Trzaskowski has promised not to veto it.
choose-if: trz_abortion_signature = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace has made no reliable signature commitment.
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_rights_bill = "Abortion-law restoration";
Q.trz_rights_bill_votes = Math.max(
    180,
    Math.min(
        250,
        Math.round(
            186 +
            (Number(Q.trz_right_fragmentation) || 0) * 1.08 +
            Math.max(
                0,
                (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 16) - 16
            ) * 0.55 +
            Math.max(0, (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 24) - 24) * 0.22 +
            Math.max(0, (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 44) - 44) * 0.16
        )
    )
);
if (Q.trz_rights_bill_votes >= 231) {
    Q.trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Passed and signed";
    Q.feminist_trust += 14;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 10;
    Q.judicial_legitimacy += 6;
    Q.president_relation += 8;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 16;
    Q.far_right_agenda += 8;
    Q.pis_poll_momentum += 0.45;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.75;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Trzaskowski signs the abortion-restoration law";
} else {
    Q.trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Defeated in the Sejm";
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.feminist_trust += 3;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 7;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.3;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The abortion-restoration bill falls before reaching the President";
}
!}
go-to: rights_result

@rights_vote_marriage
title: Put marriage equality to a vote
subtitle: Available only with an explicit presidential no-veto pledge.
choose-if: trz_marriage_signature = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Trzaskowski has not promised to sign marriage equality.
on-arrival: {!
Q.trz_rights_bill = "Marriage equality";
Q.trz_rights_bill_votes = Math.max(
    170,
    Math.min(
        246,
        Math.round(
            180 +
            (Number(Q.trz_right_fragmentation) || 0) * 1.16 +
            Math.max(
                0,
                (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 16) - 16
            ) * 0.60 +
            Math.max(0, (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 44) - 44) * 0.20 +
            Math.max(0, (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 24) - 24) * 0.12
        )
    )
);
if (Q.trz_rights_bill_votes >= 231) {
    Q.trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Passed and signed";
    Q.progressive_credibility += 14;
    Q.minority_safety += 12;
    Q.president_relation += 9;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 20;
    Q.far_right_agenda += 10;
    Q.pis_poll_momentum += 0.5;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.9;
    Q.news_headline = "Trzaskowski signs marriage equality into law";
} else {
    Q.trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Defeated in the Sejm";
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
    Q.trz_right_backlash += 10;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum += 0.45;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Marriage equality falls before reaching the President";
}
!}
go-to: rights_result

@rights_vote_institutions
title: Send another judicial-repair law instead
subtitle: A broader coalition and a safer presidential signature.
on-arrival: trz_rights_bill = "Judicial repair"; trz_rights_bill_votes = 244; trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Passed and signed"; trz_vetoes += 1; judicial_legitimacy += 10; constitutional_restraint += 7; president_relation += 5; ko_relation += 4; psl_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 3; progressive_credibility -= 2; trz_right_backlash += 5; news_headline = "Trzaskowski signs a narrow judicial-repair law"
go-to: rights_result

@rights_result
title: The signature test
new-page: true

**[+ trz_rights_bill +]** receives **[+ trz_rights_bill_votes +] votes**.
Outcome: **[+ trz_rights_bill_outcome +]**.

[? if trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Passed and signed": The promised signature is
immediate. The cohabitation presidency has made law as well as stopped it; the
right begins the next campaign around reversing the result. ?]

[? if trz_rights_bill_outcome = "Defeated in the Sejm": Trzaskowski never gets
the choice to sign or veto. The pledge remains real, but the arithmetic of a
PiS Sejm remains more important than the occupant of the Palace. ?]

- @poland_hub: Continue to the merger congress
